{"server":"en","storyId":"main_3_level_main_03-02_end","groupId":"main_3","stageId":"main_03-02","title":"Memory","storyCode":"3-2","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-02_end.txt","sourceHash":"a65717afa177f6bc4fb321def5019432ee3097ec6e4a6e18e583c4072e2bf47a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"Misha and Skullshatterer finally meet again, but nothing is as it used to be.\nSkullshatterer's hateful accusations leave Misha feeling a sense of unfamiliarity towards the person she once knew, but she can't help but to feel a thread of empathy.","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十四关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_a"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"So, you must be Misha?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Hello."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"I've heard a lot about you from Skullshatterer. Now, I finally get to meet you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you also... Infected...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes, I am."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"Why did you... join Reunion?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Why?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"My wife, my child... they were all killed by the Chernobogians."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Under Ursus, the Infected were treated worse than lifestock."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"The destruction of Chernobog...? No, no. That is far too light of a punishment..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Do you know how much blood is on their hands?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Misha... We've been feared, exploited, humiliated, and persecuted..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"...Just because of the fact that we're Infected."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Not for any other reason."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"S-sorry, I got a bit heated. Forget what I said."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Ivan, come help tend to the injured."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Coming."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"We're only using this abandoned mine as a temporary base until we can reorganize and regroup."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Once the time is right, we'll make our way back to Chernobog."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"...Al--"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"No..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"I threw away that name long ago."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"Why...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"That person already died."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Just call me Skullshatterer."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you... afraid?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"Skull...shatterer? ...Why?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Ah... You'll soon understand."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"After we learned that you ended up as a refugee in Lungmen, everyone volunteered to go rescue you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"We've also accepted many new members there."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"But... you're hurting people."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't want to... do that..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"Why are the Infected fighting each other..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"An eye for an eye, as things should be."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"There is a saying in Ursus. 'Welcome your kin as you would welcome the warm spring...'"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"'But welcome your enemies...'"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"... ... ..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"What's wrong?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"...Do you know?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"No... No, you don't."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"When they came for me, they dragged me out of my house..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"What's wrong?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"I saw my mother. She grabbed my hand..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"You saw it too."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"...No..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"You must have--"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"They beat her mercilessly, but she wouldn't let go of me..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"She left a trail of blood in the snow as they dragged her away."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"If Reunion had... If the Infected could have... If only--!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"If they came sooner, none of this would have happened!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"We would not have had to suffer so much!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"I... I wasn't brave enough to..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"I... Aaaahh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Misha..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"It'll be fine... It'll all be fine in the end."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't blame you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Back then... who would've been brave enough?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"But now, Reunion has given me that bravery."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"Al--"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"Skullshatterer..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Whether or not you trust us is up to you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Even if you trust us, whether or not you join us is also up to you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"But you are an Infected."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Reunion... will definitely fight until the bitter end so that the Infected can be free."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"But... you destroyed Chernobog."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"Along with countless innocents--"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"...Innocents?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Hah. Who's innocent?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"When Chernobog implemented the quarantine, did any of them speak out against it?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"When Ursus sent us to die in the mines and the frozen wastelands, did any of them do anything about it?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Did any of them ever stand up for us?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"I don't know..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"...Reunion has two leaders who fought for Ursus for a long time."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"They said that there were some in Ursus who stood against the government for the sake of the Infected."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"But they weren't in Chernobog."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Chernobog coldly turned a blind eye towards us as we died..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"No, they laughed as they watched us die!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Chernobog... deserved to be destroyed!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"I met other people who were helping the Infected... They..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Rhodes Island?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Despite being Infected, they helped Lungmen and harmed us, didn't they?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"They slew our comrades and decimated our brethren, didn't they?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"No..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"You couldn't see the truth. But it should be clear to you now..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"...Sorry, I let my anger take over."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"It's fine... I..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"I understand how you feel..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"You must have been suffering so much... all this time..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Everyone has been through a lot."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"But right now, at least we have hope."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Talulah... She is the one who took charge of the Infected and led the fight against the cruelty of this world."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Reunion is the only hope we have."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"I see... You've all suffered so much..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"If Reunion can really protect them all..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Of course."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"Just like how Reunion will protect everyone... I will protect you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skullshatterer","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"I won't let anyone hurt you anymore."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misha","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"Skullshatterer..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Ooh, I found 'em--!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Looks like they sustained some pretty serious losses."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Luckily, I didn't head back to the company headquarters... Otherwise, I would've needed to make a long detour for this mission..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Try to predict their escape routes."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Send all likely routes along with their bearings to Amiya."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"I'll be done in a sec!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmph."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"We can't give Reunion time to regroup."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"Hmmm, let's see... over here... like this... and that should do it!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you done, Exusiai?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Exusiai","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"What do you need? How are we going to do this?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's have a little warm-up first."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Texas","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"Start with their sentries."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_012_misa","aliases":["Misha"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["Reunion Member"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["Texas"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["Exusiai"]},{"speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","aliases":["Skullshatterer"]}]}
